From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phicomm R1 bring-up <local>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] spl: optee: pass U-Boot text base in r1 for RK322x TEE

The RK322x OP-TEE integration used by Armbian expects the non-secure
U-Boot text base in r1 while SPL transfers control to the secure monitor.
Keep the normal return address in lr as before.

---
 common/spl/spl_optee.S | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/common/spl/spl_optee.S b/common/spl/spl_optee.S
index a269904d386..a3891f00713 100644
--- a/common/spl/spl_optee.S
+++ b/common/spl/spl_optee.S
@@ -8,5 +8,6 @@
 
 ENTRY(spl_optee_entry)
 	ldr lr, =CONFIG_TEXT_BASE
+	ldr r1, =CONFIG_TEXT_BASE
 	mov pc, r3
 ENDPROC(spl_optee_entry)
-- 
2.47.1
